{"sections":[],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"text":"Colored Surface","type":"heading","anchor":"Colored-Surface","level":3},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Colored backgrounds use surface colors to maximize the contrast with content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The colors of several OUDS components (for instance ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","isActive":true},{"text":") are automatically adjusted if they are placed on ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do so, some tokens associated with these specific colors can be customized and are identified with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mono"}]},{"text":" suffix (for instance ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"colorBgDefaultEnabledMono"}]},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider"}]},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"text":"How it works","type":"heading","anchor":"How-it-works","level":4},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"According to the color, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":" component adds in SwiftUI environment two flags:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"oudsUseMonochrome","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": to inform a component that needs to use mono version of tokens","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"oudsOnColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": to inform a component it is placed on colored surface even if the mono is off","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"How to use","type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-use","level":4},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ The folowing view has a colored background \"onStatusPositiveEmphasized\" with","    \/\/ - a text with the color adapted according to the adjusted colorScheme      ","    \/\/ - a button that uses the mono version of tokens","","    \/\/ As view","    OUDSColoredSurface(color: theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized) {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","            .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","            OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","        }","    }","","    \/\/ As view modifier","","    VStack {","        Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","        .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","        OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","    }","    .coloredSurface(theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized)"]},{"text":"Debuging contrast ratios","type":"heading","anchor":"Debuging-contrast-ratios","level":4},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", also named “RGAA”."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However it is highly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for texts and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be used on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ; thus in that case we can know the surface color for a given component on it, and compute the contrast ratio, and in the end display or not warnings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To do that, some steps must be followed in your component implementation:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rise the flag to allow debugging (e.g. i #DEBUG mode)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get the environment variable defined by the colored surface containing the applied color"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the component implementation, add a line of code comparing the color to test and that surface"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then keep an eye on your logs ; warnings will be added there if WCAG 2.1 3:1, 4.5:1 or 7:1 ratios are not reached, depending to the methods you call"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Rise the flag","#if DEBUG","OUDSWCAG21Ratios.oudsDebugWCAG21Colors = true","#endif","","\/\/ Supposing we are in your component View \/ ViewModifer struct","","\/\/ Get the applied surface color","@Environment(\\.oudsSurfaceColor) var surfaceColor","","\/\/ In the function defining the color to apply, add the line below","\/\/ where colorTokenToApply is the color to apply from a theme:","","\/\/ Non-textual components, in AA","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .nonTextual)","","\/\/ Textual components and AAA to check","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .AAA)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Divider","type":"heading","anchor":"Divider","level":3},{"text":"How it works","type":"heading","anchor":"How-it-works","level":4},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A divider is used to separate content elements in a view. Two kinds of divider are proposed:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider","type":"reference"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked vertically (e.g. in ","type":"text"},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider","type":"reference"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked horizontally (e.g. in `HStack)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A divider can be colored using color enumerated in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSDividerColor"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Horizontal","level":5,"anchor":"Horizontal"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Vertical","level":5,"anchor":"Vertical"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How to use","level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Add a vertical divider between items","HStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSVerticalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}","","\/\/ Add an horizontal divider between items","VStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}"]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/layouts"]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"title":"Layouts","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Some components can be used for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"layouts"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSColoredSurface":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscoloredsurface","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSColoredSurface","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Used to define if a content is used on a colored surface."}],"type":"topic","title":"OUDSColoredSurface","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSColoredSurface","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","title":"Components","kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extensions and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLink":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Link is a UI element that allows to navigate from one location to another, either within the same page or across different pages in the same resource,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or to an external resource.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Link’s primary function is navigation and it communicates its interactive nature visually and semantically.","type":"text"}],"title":"OUDSLink","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLink","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslink","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLink","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact":{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr/":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","title":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","url":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","type":"link"},"component_coloredSurface_Orange":{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange","type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Orange theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"component_verticalDivider_Sosh":{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh","type":"image","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh":{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh","type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSDividerColor":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"List of colors available for dividers (i.e. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSVerticalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSDividerColor"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsdividercolor","kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSDividerColor","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSDividerColor"}]},"component_verticalDivider_Orange":{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange","type":"image","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Orange theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe":{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe","type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact":{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact","type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSButton":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Button is a UI element that triggers an action or event, and is used to initiate tasks or confirming an action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Button appears in different layouts, styles and states to indicate hierarchy or emphasis."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSButton"}],"title":"OUDSButton","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSButton"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbutton"},"component_horizontalDivider_Orange":{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange","type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Orange theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact":{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSHorizontalDivider":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A horizontal Divider is used to separate content laid out one under the other (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor"},{"text":" colors.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The thickness (height) is fixed by dedicated token from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"title":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudshorizontaldivider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"component_coloredSurface_Sosh":{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh","type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSVerticalDivider":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vertical Divider is used to separate content laid out side by side ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HStack"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (width) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSVerticalDivider"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsverticaldivider","kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSVerticalDivider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSVerticalDivider"}]},"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe":{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe","type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe":{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe","type":"image","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]}}}